      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "• Three/four bedroom semi detached, C rated, extending to approx. 120 sq.m/1,291 sq ft positioned on a corner site with ample off-street parking \n• Accommodation comprises entrance hallway, guest w.c., living room, family room/fourth bedroom, kitchen/dining room, utility room, three bedrooms, en-suite and family bathroom \n• Great layout with well-proportioned rooms, flooded with natural light \n• Generous south facing garden, positioned on a corner site at the end of the estate with a paved driveway providing parking for two cars, lawn and mature hedging to the front \n• Located within Gleann Na Riogh, just minutes from Naas town centre with its extensive range of amenities including schools, shops, bars, restaurants and an abundance of sporting and recreational facilities \n• Excellent commuter access via the M7 motorway at Junction 9, regular bus services from the town, and a direct train service from Sallins/Naas station to Dublin Heuston \n\nGuide Price\n425,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway \nPaved driveway with ample parking for two cars, lawn to the front with mature hedging, positioned on a corner site at the end of the estate.\n\nEntrance Hallway 1.83m x 5.00m \nLaminate flooring, with a carpeted understairs storage area.\n\nGuest W.C. 1.55m x 1.18m \nTile flooring, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nLiving Room 3.97m x 4.70m \nFeature fireplace with decorative tiled surround and wood mantel, complemented by additional sockets and detailed coving and bay window.\n\nFamily Room 4.65m x 2.44m \nAdditional sockets throughout, including a dedicated TV point.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room 3.74m x 6.00m \nConcrete flooring at present, fully fitted kitchen with eye level units, additional worktop space and decorative splashback tiles, complemented by downlights and coving. Sliding door leading out to the rear garden, with double doors opening through to the living room\n\nUtility Room 2.61m x 3.75m \nFully fitted cabinet unit with additional worktop space and splashback tiles, plumbed for a washing machine, with concrete flooring at present.\n\nLanding 1.85m x 2.70m \nCarpet flooring, with a carpeted staircase rising from the entrance hallway below.\n\nMaster Bedroom 4.00m x 3.70m \nHardwood pine flooring throughout, complete with fitted wardrobes and access to the en-suite.\n\nEn-suite 0.91m x 2.44m \nLino flooring, shower cubicle with tiled surround and power shower, w.c., w.h.b. and feature mirror.\n\nBedroom 2 3.95m x 3.69m \nHardwood pine flooring throughout, complete with fitted wardrobes and additional sockets, a good-sized double bedroom.\n\nBedroom 3 2.79m x 2.67m \nLaminate flooring, complete with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom 2.63m x 1.84m \nFully tiled floor and walls, complete with power shower, w.c., w.h.b. and towel rail.\n\nGarden \nSunny south facing rear garden, block-built boundary wall and panel fencing, lawn and side passage entrance.\n\nAdditional Information:\nBuilt 1991\n\nItems Included in sale:\nFixtures, fittings and windows dressings.\n\nServices\nMains water\nGas fired central heating \n\nBER \nC\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W91 PKW1\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nJill Wright \n045832020\n"
      },
